WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:04.380
Really? Angelo-senpai and the first-year...

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.300
What was his name?

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.470
Hibiki Kanato-kun.

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:10.210
Oh, yeah. So they came to the 
Hoshi Festival committee meeting?

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.150
Yeah.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.490
That's amazing, Kohana.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.810
Angelo-senpai is always joking around.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:18.530
I can't believe he actually 
attended a meeting.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:19.620
Really?

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.500
Speak of the devil.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:33.170
Kanato, do you really think you 
can beat my sexy basketball?

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:36.760
Anjo-senpai, I'm the kind of man 
who comes through when it counts.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.100
I never miss a shot.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:40.900
Interesting.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:42.350
Let's test that theory?

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:43.560
Here I come.

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.020
All right.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:51.980
What?

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:00.120
You're still not sexy enough, Kanato.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:03.120
Angelo!

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:04.620
How beautiful.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:05.910
Huh?

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:07.720
Hey, little flower.

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.650
Is it time for our meeting?

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:10.840
Yeah.

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:13.260
Roger that. In that case...

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:18.010
With love from Louis Louis 
to all my cute princesses...

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:20.510
Love shot!

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:22.900
Just kidding.

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:26.040
Damn it! What the heck is sexy basketball?

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.480
I don't get it!

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:29.380
Neither do I.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:51.100
<b>Magic-Kyun! Renaissance</b>

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:05.950
Dancing on the Moonlight

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:14.710
<b>75 days until the Summer Festival!</b>

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:08.680
Let's get started.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:09.460
Yes, sir.

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:12.750
First I'll assign the remaining 
roles on the executive committee.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.710
The principal made me 
decide these in a hurry.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.010
Anjo Louis, you're in charge of planning.

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:18.960
Planning? Okay.

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:21.680
Hibiki Kanato, you're in charge 
of event space management.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:22.720
Got it!

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:25.010
Young boys are so full of energy.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.210
Thank you.

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:30.380
Tsukushi Monet and Tatewaki Rintaro will be 
in charge of accounting and promotions.

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:31.980
Those two haven't shown up yet.

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:36.610
I'm sorry. I haven't been 
able to meet with them yet.

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:40.240
Is it possible they're actually illusions?

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:42.490
Illusions?

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:48.010
I've heard ghosts appear 
in the training building.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:49.530
Ghosts?

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:51.500
Are you being serious?

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:54.890
Ichijoji, I'll leave the rest up to you.

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:56.730
Conduct the meeting with the present members.

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:58.050
Understood.

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:04.260
Today, I'd like to start by deciding on a 
direction for the Hoshi Festival dance party.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:06.990
Is that all right, Anjo-senpai?

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:07.640
Go ahead.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.430
The dance party?

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:10.980
There's a dance party?

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.660
There sure is.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.140
What? Where?

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:17.180
Chairman, it looks like some of us don't know.

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:20.090
Could you briefly describe the 
events of the Hoshi Festival?

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:24.610
I've actually never really 
participated before,

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.000
so I don't know either.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.250
What?

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.240
Please.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:31.240
Very well.

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:35.620
I'm sure you're already aware that 
the main event of the Hoshi Festival

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.170
is the executive committee's Art Session.

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:38.380
Yeah.

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:42.510
There are other presentations, 
stage events, and shops,

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:47.010
but the festival is concluded with 
a dance party for all students.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.580
Wow!

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:49.890
How wonderful.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:54.200
Naturally, the committee members 
will be attending the party

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.150
and must lead the dance.

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:57.940
D-Dance?

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:01.530
Hey, isn't this your mom?

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.590
You're right.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.190
She's a beautiful lady.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:07.910
Yeah. She's super cool.

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:11.290
Yeah. My mom is amazing.

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:14.540
Legendary people certainly 
aren't like the rest of us.

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:17.510
Are you a good dancer, too?

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:20.290
What? W-Well...

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.050
As long as you're a member of the committee,

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.170
I won't let you claim that you can't dance.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.130
O-Okay.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.890
Wh-What should I do?

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.060
It's okay.

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:30.850
You'll be fine as long as you practice.

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:31.460
Dancing...

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:32.640
Y-Yeah, you're right.

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:36.940
Besides, isn't dancing your 
specialty, Anjo-senpai?

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:39.920
Why don't you have him teach you?

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:40.770
Oh.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.280
You're right.

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:47.530
I'm not so sure.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:50.610
What? Senpai, aren't you a dance major?

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:51.880
I don't know.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.040
What?

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:04.290
I'm finally able to use magical arts,

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:07.260
but there's still so much I have to do.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:09.640
I found it.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.010
Dance 
Lesson

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.010
Dance lessons 
for beginners!

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.520
I know I can do it.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:19.520
"The fundamental moves of the waltz are 
the natural turn and the reverse turn."

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:23.650
I see. "Let's try taking some steps."

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:26.650
One, two, three?

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.830
Why?

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:39.580
Huh?

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:42.840
Here you go, my little flower.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:46.710
Anjo-senpai. Thank you.

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:49.970
You're such a serious little flower.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:52.590
You're learning how to dance 
after what the king said to you.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:54.410
Oh, actually...

00:06:54.410 --> 00:07:01.230
But you can't dance properly
 while looking down, can you?

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:04.730
Start by standing up straight 
and learning the steps.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:07.600
Are you ready?

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:08.490
Yes.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:09.990
Here we go.

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:11.740
One, two, three.

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:12.970
One, two, three.

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:14.680
One, two, three.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:18.150
Take larger, more elegant steps, 
and straighten your posture.

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:20.600
That's it.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.690
One, two, three.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.050
One, two, three.

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:25.710
One, two, three.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.800
They're so beautiful.

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:30.970
What?

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.680
Oh, um...

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:36.180
You must really love dancing.

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:37.890
Love?

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:45.810
I don't know about that. I wish that I did.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.400
Just kidding.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:48.190
What?

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:51.450
That's the end of our lesson.

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:55.070
Um, I...

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.950
Huh? You're here, Georgie?

00:07:58.450 --> 00:07:59.370
Georgie?

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.800
Ichijoji is such a long name.

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:03.960
And don't you think that Georgie is cuter?

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:06.570
You're one Georgie, one Joji, Ichijoji.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:07.970
Just kidding.

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:14.440
Aren't you tired of going through life 
making fun of everyone and everything?

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:21.620
If you're not going to try,

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:23.440
please stop coming to the meetings.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.690
You're just bothering everyone else.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:27.940
Ichijoji-kun?

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.180
You're harsh, aren't you?

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:33.640
No wonder you're the king of the academy.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.780
You're right.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:36.990
Anjo-senpai.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.580
See you later, little flower.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.060
Good luck with your dancing.

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:44.000
Why would you say that?

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:49.130
As a child, he was a dancing prodigy.

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:55.400
He was invited to attend the academy 
by the principal for his great talent.

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:01.120
But he never attended classes.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:04.530
Instead of graduating last 
year, he stayed another year.

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:06.810
He still remains at the academy.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:13.860
But why?

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:17.860
Anjo-senpai always produces so many sparkles.

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:23.870
It's sacrilegious for those 
with talent not to work hard.

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:33.380
Hey. Welcome back, Angelo.

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:37.380
I made a new and improved 
carrot cake. You want some?

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:43.920
It's delicious.

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:46.210
It's not too carroty at all. It's good.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.990
All right! You gave my carrot 
cake the green light.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:51.400
I'm going to feed this to Monet.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:55.410
By the way, Rin Rin, why don't you come 
to the Hoshi Festival committee meetings?

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:56.560
What?

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:59.910
It sounded like the little flower 
has been looking for you.

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:02.490
You mean the flower petal girl?

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:05.830
Oh, right. Sorry.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.280
I have a lot going on.

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:08.250
Something on your mind?

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:11.060
No, it's not like that.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:12.630
I just don't have time.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.920
I haven't even been able to work 
on my sculpture assignment.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:19.450
Aw, jeez! What am I going to do?

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.000
Sounds rough.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:27.640
Those photos are for my next assignment.

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:31.150
Aren't their bodies beautiful?

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:34.440
I'm going to give it my best shot, but...

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:50.200
Louis.

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:53.080
Why are you taking a break?

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:54.420
This isn't a game.

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:59.680
Remember, you're dancing to win, Louis.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:04.810
You were born only to dance.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:09.520
Do as I say so you can win.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.310
Do you want to be a loser?

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.320
You must always be number one.

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:19.070
Just keep dancing.

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:30.710
Mom...

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.920
I don't have to dance anymore.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:42.050
You only have to dance when 
you feel like dancing.

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:46.250
I'll never feel like dancing.

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:49.740
I'm tired of dancing.

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:53.310
<i>You're dancing to win, Louis.</i>

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:58.490
Dancing... Dancing is...

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:02.080
Louis. Louis.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:03.220
Louis!

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:06.580
Are you okay?

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:09.330
Yeah...

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:13.950
I was just recalling some bad memories.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:18.230
I thought I'd forgotten and sealed them away.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.440
Just kidding.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:23.340
Louis.

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.970
Thanks. I'm fine.

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:29.420
For you.

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:31.260
Magic-Kyun.

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:34.350
Magic-Kyun.

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.010
Renaissance.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:39.480
<b>73 days until the Summer Festival!</b>

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:45.910
I'm finished.

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:54.870
That's great.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.900
Y-You scared me.

00:12:57.680 --> 00:13:02.260
Aigasaki-senpai, you lose track of your 
surroundings when you're focused, don't you?

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:04.560
What? I'm not sure.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:05.780
I'm the same.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:08.100
People tell me I'm like that all the time.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.220
What?

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:12.850
I don't know how I feel about my little 
flower and Kanato being the same.

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:15.760
You don't seem to like the idea.

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:16.980
Can you tell?

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.870
Yeah, even I can see that.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:22.340
Really? I should remember that.

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:23.490
Yeah.

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:27.900
Anjo-senpai, I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:31.560
It's not your fault, my little flower.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.620
What are you talking about?

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:36.720
It's just between us adults.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:38.170
What does that mean?

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:44.590
Anyway, looking at Aigasaki's 
flower arrangements heals my soul.

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:48.090
It was the same when she made 
it rain cherry blossom petals.

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:51.100
What does it take to produce 
such a gentle light?

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.140
I know.

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:56.170
I actually starting coming to the 
meetings because I wanted to know

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:59.600
what kind of girl was creating 
such a warm Light of Arte.

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:02.230
What? Really?

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.470
Yeah.

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:04.480
Me, too.

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:07.920
Do you like arranging 
flowers, my little flower?

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:08.610
Yes.

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:13.140
I want to be as much like my mom as I can.

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:16.120
Although there are times 
that I struggle with it.

00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:20.500
Well, your mom is a legendary figure.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:25.260
But I like touching the flowers.

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:28.130
More than anything, I love doing it.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:31.140
Really?

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:31.980
Yeah.

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:34.340
What's wrong, Ichijoji?

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:35.390
Nothing.

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:37.360
Let's get started.

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:38.310
Okay.

00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:58.120
Monet.

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:01.460
Look. I baked you a new cake.

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:07.540
It smells like carrots.

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:08.840
You could tell?

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.980
Rin, do you want some?

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.500
Rin doesn't want any, either.

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:17.100
I'm late.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:19.390
Bamboo shoots...

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.190
Come to think of it,

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:25.940
Louis asked me why I wasn't coming 
to Hoshi Festival committee meetings.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.220
What about you?

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:30.490
Yeah, Hibiki might've mentioned something.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:33.280
Tsukushi, are you listening?

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.870
Are you listening? You're barely responding.

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:38.720
I was wearing earplugs, but 
I could still hear him.

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:40.250
That's impressive.

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:45.880
I see. I was thinking I 
should at least show up.

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:48.420
We were chosen without our consent.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.510
We don't have time to do that.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:59.020
<b>72 days until the Summer Festival!</b>

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.680
72 more days, huh?

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.220
I feel sort of nervous.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.020
Senpai, it's too soon for that.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:02.000
Now's probably not a bad 
time to start hurrying.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:02.890
What?!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.900
Are we behind schedule?

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.400
Wh-Wh-What are we going to do?

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:08.900
All we can do is do what we have to do.

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:10.770
Let's get started.

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:11.840
Okay.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.160
I made it.

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:17.280
You didn't make it. You're late today, too.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:17.900
What?

00:16:17.900 --> 00:16:19.790
And put those bamboo shoots away.

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:25.040
Today, we'll assign locations for the 
various events of the Summer Festival.

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:27.840
Aigasaki, could you hand these out?

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:28.400
Okay.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:33.550
Modern Literature B

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:33.550
Dance Lesson

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:32.530
We can use the field, too?

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:35.850
I'd like to make my room out of bounds.

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:37.300
It's not your room.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.560
It's a training room.

